    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Although various PINN models have been successfully applied to the study of ordinary and partial differential equations, particularly in the case of the wave equation, our investigation shows that their performance deteriorates in large scale domain and long time range, potentially leading to non-convergence."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
