    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "For example, let us consider two scenarios for two-dimensional wave propagation equation with Dirichlet boundary in Ω1 = [0,2π] × [0,2π],t ∈ (0,2). Ω2 = [0,10π] × [0,10π],t ∈ (0,10), respectively. The governed equation is"
