    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "layers (except for the output layer) are selected as GELU(x) = x· 21[1+erf(√x2)], where erf(x) is Gaussian error function, and the output layers of all subnetworks are linear. We train the previously mentioned PINN"
